    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s06-t03-drill-09-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第9题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s06-t03-drill-09",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（23浙江）A、B两地直线距离为320千米，甲车从A地、乙车从B地同时出发相向而行。已知甲车的速度是乙车的3倍，乙车与甲车相遇后，立即右转弯90度并保持原速度继续行驶。那么甲车到达B地时，其与乙车之间的距离：",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "小于80千米"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "80~90千米"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "90~100千米"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "大于100千米"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "B",
        "sourceAnswer": "B"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          70
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          64
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s06-t03-drill-09-p070.webp",
            "alt": "行程问题（一） · 实战精刷9 · 讲义第64页",
            "pdfPage": 70
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s06-t03-drill-09-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s06-t03-drill-09",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：B"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先用速度比3∶1分320千米：相遇时甲走240，乙走80，甲还剩80千米到B。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "从相遇到甲到B，甲走80时乙走80/3千米，而且乙已转90度，所以此时两车距离是直角三角形斜边。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "d=\\sqrt{80^2+(80/3)^2}=\\frac{80\\sqrt{10}}3\\approx84.3\\text{千米}"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "落在80—90千米，选B。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          70
